  can the end-anchored matcher's subject contain text appended after the value? false

§4  the refused rendering, applied to the anchor pattern directly
  pattern   : /^(\s*tracked files read: )(\d+)$/
  landed    : "  tracked files read: 1083" → match true
  appended  : "  tracked files read: 1083 (1084 in scope, 1 excluded, 0 unreadable)" → match false
  so the pattern really would refuse the appended form. The question this unit answers is
  whether that pattern is ever applied to text that could CARRY the appended form.
